Z||000000||Joe Torma||12-18-2001||11:40 PM||||Little better captured pics this time(I had idiot mode set on my camcorder last time--bad auto settings!)....<P>I decided to cut up the one sheet of EL, and I was hoping that the little sheet was going to be brighter than the whole-sheet atempt...oh man was it!!!!!!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Decided on white lettering because of the purple EL being red when off.<P>OFF...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/badge-off_1.JPG"> <P>ON...it is more red than this, but its hard to take pictures of glowing things and keep the color right.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/badge-on1.JPG"> <BR>More like this...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/badge-on2.JPG"> <P>Also note that the white does glow white a bit...less than the pics.<P>Somebody take this stuff away from me...hmmm....can I make my whole car glow??? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>So, now I'll make the holder/mount thingie(encapsulates the EL material).  It will be like the nose emblem-Black plastic back and clear front.<P>Whaddya think?  It looks so cool in person!<BR>Oh, its about 5" high, a perfect size for the fender.<P>------------------<BR>Its never going to be finished...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig2_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
